    "name": "Baseer API (بصـير) - Complete Test Suite",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for testing all Baseer backend endpoints:\n- User Preferences & Consents (Protected with JWT)\n- System Health\n- OCR & Document Reading\n- Voice Assistant (Egyptian Dialect)\n- Indoor Navigation (QR-based)\n- Computer Vision (Currency, Obstacles, Signs, Color, Expressions, Scene)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
